  {
   "id": "dragon-quest-x-mezameshi-itsutsu-no-shuzoku-offline-149989@post-2024-05-29",
   "gameId": "dragon-quest-x-mezameshi-itsutsu-no-shuzoku-offline-149989",
   "displayName": "關於無法以繁體中文遊玩的問題",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-05-29T12:32:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "●更新內容",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam版的《勇者鬥惡龍X 覺醒的五種族 OFFLINE》無法以繁體中文遊玩的問題現已修正。",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "非常抱歉造成各位玩家困擾。",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "若您已經購買遊戲，只要從Steam用戶端的語言設定變更語言，遊戲便會套用並下載設定的語言檔案。",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1.開啟Steam收藏庫",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.在遊戲名稱上按右鍵，選擇「內容」",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.開啟「一般」分頁",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4.從下拉式選單中選擇想使用的語言",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5.遊戲會開始下載設定的語言檔案",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "本問題花費較長時間調查詳情及發出相關公告，敝公司深感抱歉，懇請您海涵。",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
